# =============================================================================
# Moodpaper - Local Environment Variables Example
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. Do NOT put real secrets in this example file.
# 2. Copy this file to '.env' for local development.
# 3. '.env' is ignored by git and will never be committed.
# =============================================================================

# Google AI Studio Gemini API Key (Optional)
# Moodpaper's editorial illustrations are 100% automatic and built with SVG/HTML/CSS at zero cost.
# GEMINI_API_KEY is only used server-side for:
# - Optional generative story narratives (Gemini 2.5 Flash)
# - Optional Visual Business Agent grounded Q&A
# Never exposed in frontend JavaScript bundles or git commits.
# Get a key from: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Market Data Provider API Key
# Sourced from Alpha Vantage (https://www.alphavantage.co/) or Finnhub (https://finnhub.io/)
# If left blank, Moodpaper honestly states that live market quotes are unconfigured.
MARKET_DATA_API_KEY=
MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER=alphavantage

# Optional News Search API Key (e.g. NewsAPI https://newsapi.org/ or GNews)
# If unconfigured, Moodpaper retrieves real news from public publisher RSS feeds.
NEWS_API_KEY=
